{'symbol': 'ON', 'date': '2020-04-09 20:30:00', 'title': "ON SEMICONDUCTOR SAYS AS PART OF CO'S ONGOING EFFORTS TO REDUCE COSTS, DETERMINED TO IMPLEMENT CERTAIN EMPLOYEE TERMINATIONS DURING H1 2020", 'text': "ON SEMICONDUCTOR - ON APRIL 3, AS PART OF CO'S ONGOING EFFORTS TO REDUCE COSTS, DETERMINED TO IMPLEMENT CERTAIN EMPLOYEE TERMINATIONS DURING H1 2020.ON SEMICONDUCTOR - EMPLOYEE TERMINATIONS WILL IMPACT ABOUT 475 OF CO'S EMPLOYEES LOCATED IN CO’S CORPORATE HEADQUARTERS, OTHER LOCATIONS WHERE CO HAS OPERATIONS.ON SEMICONDUCTOR - ESTIMATES WILL INCUR BETWEEN $43 MILLION & $47 MILLION IN COSTS DURING Q1, Q2 2020 IN CONNECTION WITH EMPLOYMENT SEPARATIONS.ON SEMICONDUCTOR - EMPLOYMENT SEPARATIONS COMPONENT OF COST SAVINGS MEASURES EXPECTED TO RESULT IN ONGOING ANNUAL COST SAVINGS BETWEEN $65 MILLION & $70 MILLION."}